flowchart TD
    U[User] --> CLI[Python CLI - main.py]
    CLI --> ING[Video ingestion]
    ING --> URL[Validate URL and extract video ID]
    URL --> CAP[Fetch available YouTube captions]
    CAP --> CLEAN[Clean transcript segments]
    CLEAN --> CHUNK[Timestamp-aware chunking with overlap]
    CHUNK --> EMB[Embedding provider]
    EMB --> STORE[(Vector store: Chroma or memory)]
    CHUNK --> RAW[Local cleaned transcript JSON]

    CLI --> Q[Question / topic / summary / compare / learning]
    Q --> VS[Vector search]
    Q --> BM[BM25 lexical search]
    VS --> RRF[Hybrid merge with Reciprocal Rank Fusion]
    BM --> RRF
    RRF --> RR[Configured reranker]
    RR --> CTX[Top-K timestamped transcript chunks]
    CTX --> LLM[LLM provider: Groq / OpenAI-compatible / Ollama / fake]
    LLM --> ANS[Answer or generated learning material]
    CTX --> CITE[Timestamp citation builder]
    ANS --> OUT[CLI response]
    CITE --> OUT

    CLI --> EVAL[Evaluation command]
    EVAL --> METRICS[Recall@K / Precision@K / Hit Rate@K / MRR / latency]
    EVAL --> GM[Generation: relevance / groundedness / citation accuracy]
    STORE -. reads .-> VS
    STORE -. reads .-> BM
